{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851320/extras/fcc565afea03fe953bc210bc10144012.poster.avif?t=1770808744\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851320/extras/fcc565afea03fe953bc210bc10144012.webm?t=1770808744\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851320/extras/fcc565afea03fe953bc210bc10144012.mp4?t=1770808744\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UFOPHILIA</strong> is a first-person psychological horror game where you play as an investigator obsessed with the UFO phenomenon. Explore remote locations full of anomalies, use specialized technology, and face the unknown. Your goal: discover which alien is present\u2026 and manage to photograph it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each mission is random\u2014you never know what type of alien you\u2019ll encounter. But with the help of the UFOPHILIA software, you\u2019ll have all the necessary tools to search, identify, and photograph any alien.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But it won\u2019t be easy\u2014they're watching us too. You'll experience terrifying phenomena. Some aliens are aggressive, others curious, even playful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on this unsettling adventure, as fascinating as it is dangerous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851320/extras/faedfd4ca6933ac299536f4c2117d46a.poster.avif?t=1770808744\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851320/extras/faedfd4ca6933ac299536f4c2117d46a.webm?t=1770808744\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851320/extras/faedfd4ca6933ac299536f4c2117d46a.mp4?t=1770808744\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHAT\u2019S YOUR MISSION?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Phase 1</strong> \u2013 Select the mission: Missions are locations with reports of close encounters. The more missions you complete, the more missions you'll unlock.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Phase 2</strong> \u2013 Identification: Use the available tools to determine what kind of alien is in the area, but don\u2019t overuse them. Just a tip.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Phase 3</strong> \u2013 Spawn zone: You must identify the spawn zone, a smaller area where the alien first appeared. It\u2019s variable and essential for gathering the required evidence.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Phase 4</strong> \u2013 This is not a game: In Phase 4 the alien becomes visible\u2014it\u2019s time to take the photo. Each alien behaves differently, and you must complete their unique objectives to get close enough. Read their descriptions carefully.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851320/extras/54dedf2b1e702eee1035042f8ec65e44.poster.avif?t=1770808744\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851320/extras/54dedf2b1e702eee1035042f8ec65e44.webm?t=1770808744\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851320/extras/54dedf2b1e702eee1035042f8ec65e44.mp4?t=1770808744\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric horror:</strong> Missions are unpredictable. Spawn zones and alien types vary. Aliens can be curious, aggressive, try to abduct you, or simply play with your fears.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nine unique alien types:</strong> Each with distinct behaviors, signs, reactions, and weaknesses. Remember\u2014this is not a game. Abductions are terrifying events.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Specialized tools:</strong> EMF detectors, night vision cameras, remote microphones, microwave meters, or heart rate sensors are just some of the tools at your disposal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real device synergies:</strong> Certain tools enhance others when used strategically. Not everything is in the manual.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roswell Points and level-based economy:</strong> Unlock upgrades, new tools, and scenarios by earning Roswell Points and prestige levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full replayability:</strong> Aliens spawn randomly. Every mission is different and unique. Many factors can make your run short or long.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endings and ranks based on performance: </strong>From \u201cForum Conspiracy Theorist\u201d to the prestigious \u201cRoswell Agent.\u201d Achieve the highest rank in every mission to become a legend.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Welcome to your first investigation","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3851320/b8792da3c6f39bbf77ba35200063b1f6480cdc4e.jpg"},{"name":"The first photo","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3851320/970e1639ae2abfc4f586ddadd7a65f9bb2c9da39.jpg"},{"name":"References","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3851320/168fc10dc443d24216d02ef09dd90252e0e863e4.jpg"},{"name":"UFO explorer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3851320/45ed3f3fce390cd4e12dcafa8fd64871432a80d4.jpg"},{"name":"New horizons","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3851320/0b8deeb3990713c5dbb4e4ae5398b842c4185b88.jpg"},{"name":"Time to improve","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3851320/73469bfebb0fd781c7edfb0d6c2755aba421d84a.jpg"},{"name":"Close Encounter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3851320/40e0fdf24df94b04921ca70048fe61878f22233e.jpg"},{"name":"Not to me","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3851320/3b7f15560ffd6a68670cc4c8f5dffe06ed538e75.jpg"},{"name":"Professional ufologist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3851320/0d9fb3ded4061b2da95e190523ae400959b75d8d.jpg"},{"name":"Expert photographer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3851320/61c994762de07ae98e2357c0772583761e48527e.jpg"}],"total":12},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3851320?t=1770808744","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851320/d343d1a1cf54d80b17239d9e48fe9f0c03621087/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770808744","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851320/5cee4630a6851a3d137289a755f55e2abf90a1f9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770808744","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851320/5cee4630a6851a3d137289a755f55e2abf90a1f9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770808744","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":1